    {"type":"text","id":"step0_lbl","x":72,"y":363,"width":1356,"height":45,"text":"DB Extraction  \u2014  db_extract.py  |  Fetch all 4 datasets from PostgreSQL via psycopg2  |  Writes raw CSVs to raw_data/  |  Credentials via GCP Secret Manager (Cloud Run) or db_credentials.json (local)","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"opacity":100},

